  },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"lingering\",\n      \"title\": \"Lingering\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 5,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Walk briskly through\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Pause and linger\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Paper's Table 2 item, 5 = excellent (Pause and linger) ... 1 = very poor (Walk briskly through); shown with 5 on the left as in the paper. Keyed by design rendering: A1, A2 (main road, width >= 6 m), B1, B2 (side road, 4-5 m), C1, C2 (front-of-house road, 5-6 m), as labelled in the paper's Figure 2 and Table 1.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"enjoyment\",\n      \"title\": \"Enjoyment\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 5,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Feel unenjoyable\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Feel enjoyable\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Paper's Table 2 item, 5 = excellent (Feel enjoyable) ... 1 = very poor (Feel unenjoyable); shown with 5 on the left as in the paper. Keyed by design rendering: A1, A2 (main road, width >= 6 m), B1, B2 (side road, 4-5 m), C1, C2 (front-of-house road, 5-6 m), as labelled in the paper's Figure 2 and Table 1.\"\n     },\n     {\n      \"type\": \"rating\",\n      \"name\": \"security\",\n      \"title\": \"Security\",\n      \"rateMin\": 1,\n      \"rateMax\": 5,\n      \"minRateDescription\": \"Feel unsafe\",\n      \"maxRateDescription\": \"Feel safe\",\n      \"isRequired\": true,\n      \"description\": \"Paper's Table 2 item, 5 = excellent (Feel safe) ... 1 = very poor (Feel unsafe); shown with 5 on the left as in the paper. Keyed by design rendering: A1, A2 (main road, width >= 6 m), B1, B2 (side road, 4-5 m), C1, C2 (front-of-house road, 5-6 m), as labelled in the paper's Figure 2 and Table 1.\"\n     }\n    ]\n   }\n  ]\n }\n}\n</script>\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"rural-original\">{\"source\": \"Wang, Yang & Wang (2025) PLOS ONE 20(6): e0326049\", \"n\": 33, \"participants\": \"33 adults aged 18-60 (mean 27.3) who had never lived in the village, at least high-school education, roughly 1:1 gender; lab eye tracking, December 2023 (the shared data file has 31 per image)\", \"means_from_S1_data\": {\"A1\": {\"scale\": 3.77, \"aesthetics\": 4.39, \"publicness\": 4.13, \"lingering\": 3.9, \"enjoyment\": 3.81, \"security\": 4.13}, \"A2\": {\"scale\": 4.1, \"aesthetics\": 4.45, \"publicness\": 4.29, \"lingering\": 4.19, \"enjoyment\": 3.84, \"security\": 4.13}, \"B1\": {\"scale\": 4.1, \"aesthetics\": 4.42, \"publicness\": 4.39, \"lingering\": 4.32, \"enjoyment\": 4.19, \"security\": 4.48}, \"B2\": {\"scale\": 4.03, \"aesthetics\": 4.1, \"publicness\": 3.87, \"lingering\": 3.81, \"enjoyment\": 3.94, \"security\": 4.13}, \"C1\": {\"scale\": 4.06, \"aesthetics\": 4.16, \"publicness\": 3.74, \"lingering\": 3.94, \"enjoyment\": 3.77, \"security\": 3.94}, \"C2\": {\"scale\": 3.94, \"aesthetics\": 4.26, \"publicness\": 4.26, \"lingering\": 4.26, \"enjoyment\": 3.84, \"security\": 4.0}}, \"result\": \"Cronbach's alpha 0.826. Street scale changed only perceived safety (Kruskal-Wallis p = 0.015): side roads (4-5 m) felt safer than front-of-house roads. Paving material, wall composition, facilities and greenery colours differed on aesthetics, publicness, lingering, pleasantness and safety; more greenery invited lingering.\"}</script>\n<style>\n:root{--bg:#f1f4f2;--card:#fff;--ink:#1e2622;--muted:#5b6660;--accent:#1f6f5c;--line:#d6dfda;--warn:#b3261e;--sel:#e2f1ec}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:17px/1.55 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",Roboto,sans-serif}\nmain{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:22px 16px 40px}\nh1{font-size:1.5rem;margin:0 0 8px}h2{font-size:1.15rem;margin:0 0 8px}p{margin:0 0 12px;color:var(--muted)}\n.card{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px}\n.btn{appearance:none;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 20px;font:inherit;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;background:var(--accent);color:#fff}\n.btn:disabled{opacity:.35;cursor:not-allowed}\n.prog{font-size:.88rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px}\n.view{position:fixed;inset:0;background:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:5}\n.view img{width:min(96vw,720px);height:auto;display:block}\n.cross{font-size:48px;color:#333;font-weight:300}\n.thumb{width:100%;max-width:420px;border-radius:8px;display:block;margin:0 auto 12px}\n.bi{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:10px}.bi .l{text-align:right;font-size:.88rem}.bi .r{font-size:.88rem}.row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,40px);gap:4px}\n.row label{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:6px 0;cursor:pointer;font-size:.82rem}\n.row label:has(input:checked){background:var(--sel);border-color:var(--accent)}\n.row input{margin:0 0 2px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.bi{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.bi .row{grid-column:1/-1;order:3;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr)}.bi .l{text-align:left}.bi .r{text-align:right}}\n.ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:.8rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px}\ntextarea{width:100%;font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;min-height:60px}\nlabel.opt{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;margin-top:6px;cursor:pointer}\n.f{margin-top:16px}\ninput[type=number]{font:inherit;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;width:110px}\n.err{color:var(--warn);margin-top:8px;min-height:1.2em}\n.credit{max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 16px 24px;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--muted)}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main id=\"app\" aria-live=\"polite\"><p>Loading…</p></main>\n<footer class=\"credit\">Design renderings: Wang, Yang &amp; Wang (2025), PLOS ONE 20(6): e0326049, Figure 2 (doi:10.1371/journal.pone.0326049, CC BY 4.0).</footer>\n<script>\n(function(){\n  var KEY='rural-streets:state', T=window.__VIEWMS?{fix:window.__VIEWMS,view:window.__VIEWMS}:{fix:10000,view:10000};\n  var ITEMS=[['scale','Appropriate scale','Inappropriate scale'],['aesthetics','Beautiful','Ugly'],['publicness','Public','Private'],['lingering','Pause and linger','Walk briskly through'],['enjoyment','Feel enjoyable','Feel unenjoyable'],['security','Feel safe','Feel unsafe']];\n  var app=document.getElementById('app'), Q={}, files={}, ids=[], st=null;\n  function esc(s){return String(s==null?'':s).replace(/[&<>\"]/g,function(c){return {'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','\"':'&quot;'}[c];});}\n  function err(m){var e=app.querySelector('.err');if(e)e.textContent=m||'';}\n  function ok(r){return !(r&&r.ok===false);}\n  function save(){try{localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(st));}catch(e){}}\n  function shuffle(a){a=a.slice();for(var i=a.length-1;i>0;i--){var j=Math.floor(Math.random()*(i+1)),t=a[i];a[i]=a[j];a[j]=t;}return a;}\n  function send(list,b,next){if(b)b.disabled=true;Promise.all(list).then(function(rs){var bad=rs.filter(function(r){return !ok(r);})[0];if(bad){if(b)b.disabled=false;return err(bad.error);}next();});}\n  function val(name){var x=app.querySelector('input[name=\"'+name+'\"]:checked');return x?x.value:null;}\n  function radios(q){return '<div class=\"f\"><b>'+esc(Q[q].title)+'</b>'+(Q[q].choices||[]).map(function(c){return '<label class=\"opt\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"'+q+'\" value=\"'+esc(c.value)+'\"> '+esc(c.text)+'</label>';}).join('')+'</div>';}\n  function intro(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Rural street designs</h1><p>You will see '+st.order.length+' design renderings of village streets in northern China. Before each one, look at the cross in the middle of the screen for 10 seconds to rest your eyes. Then look at the street for 10 seconds and rate how it makes you feel on six short scales. It takes about 8 minutes.</p><div class=\"card\"><label class=\"opt\" style=\"margin-top:0\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"ok\"> '+esc(Q.consent.title)+'</label><div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Start</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){if(!document.getElementById('ok').checked)return err('Consent is needed to continue.');send([SPSite.answer('consent',true)],this,function(){st.step='about';save();route();});};\n  }\n  function about(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h2>About you</h2><div class=\"card\">'+radios('gender')+radios('age_range')+radios('education')+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Continue</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var g=val('gender'),a=val('age_range'),ed=val('education');\n      if(!g||!a||!ed)return err('Please answer every question.');\n      send([SPSite.answer('gender',g),SPSite.answer('age_range',a),SPSite.answer('education',ed)],this,function(){st.step='trial';st.k=0;st.phase='view';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function trial(){\n    if(st.phase==='q')return rate();\n    var id=st.order[st.k],im=new Image();im.src=files[id].url;im.alt='Rural street design rendering';\n    var v=document.createElement('div');v.className='view';v.innerHTML='<div class=\"cross\">+</div>';app.innerHTML='';app.appendChild(v);\n    setTimeout(function(){v.innerHTML='';v.appendChild(im);setTimeout(function(){st.phase='q';save();route();},T.view);},T.fix);\n  }\n  function rate(){\n    var id=st.order[st.k],h='';\n    ITEMS.forEach(function(it){h+='<div class=\"f\" style=\"margin-top:12px\"><b>'+esc(Q[it[0]].title)+'</b><div class=\"bi\"><span class=\"l\">'+esc(it[1])+'</span><div class=\"row\">';for(var i=5;i>=1;i--)h+='<label><input type=\"radio\" name=\"q_'+it[0]+'\" value=\"'+i+'\">'+i+'</label>';h+='</div><span class=\"r\">'+esc(it[2])+'</span></div></div>';});\n    app.innerHTML='<div class=\"prog\">Street '+(st.k+1)+' of '+st.order.length+'</div><div class=\"card\"><img class=\"thumb\" alt=\"The street you just saw\" src=\"'+esc(files[id].url)+'\"><p style=\"color:var(--ink)\">Please answer based on the picture you just saw. 5 = excellent, 4 = good, 3 = fair, 2 = poor, 1 = very poor.</p>'+h+'<div style=\"margin-top:16px\"><button class=\"btn\" id=\"go\">Next street</button></div><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    document.getElementById('go').onclick=function(){\n      var vals={},miss=ITEMS.some(function(it){var x=val('q_'+it[0]);vals[it[0]]=x;return x==null;});\n      if(miss)return err('Please answer all six scales.');\n      var sh=[files[id].name];\n      send(ITEMS.map(function(it){return SPSite.answer(it[0],Number(vals[it[0]]),{key:id,shown:sh});}),this,function(){st.k++;st.phase='view';if(st.k>=st.order.length)st.step='done';save();route();});\n    };\n  }\n  function finish(){\n    app.innerHTML='<h1>Thank you!</h1><div class=\"card\"><p id=\"fin\">Submitting…</p><div class=\"err\"></div></div>';\n    SPSite.complete().then(function(r){if(!ok(r)){err(r.error||'Some answers are missing.');setTimeout(function(){st.step='intro';save();route();},1800);}\n      else{try{localStorage.removeItem(KEY);}catch(e){}var s=document.getElementById('fin');if(s)s.textContent='Your answers are saved.';}});\n  }\n  function route(){var s=st.step;window.scrollTo(0,0);if(s==='about')return about();if(s==='trial')return trial();if(s==='done')return finish();intro();}\n  SPSite.onReady(function(ctx){\n    ['consent','gender','age_range','education'].concat(ITEMS.map(function(i){return i[0];})).forEach(function(n){Q[n]=SPSite.getQuestion(n)||{};});\n    (SPSite.getMedia('streets')||[]).forEach(function(f){if(/\\.(png|jpe?g|webp)$/i.test(f.name)){var k=f.name.replace(/\\.[^.]+$/,'');files[k]=f;ids.push(k);}});\n    if(ids.length<2){app.innerHTML='<h1>Images missing</h1><p>Upload the renderings to the media folder \"streets\".</p>';return;}\n    try{st=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));}catch(e){st=null;}\n    var valid=st&&st.order&&st.order.length===ids.length&&st.order.every(function(x){return files[x];});\n    if(!valid)st={step:'intro',order:shuffle(ids),k:0,phase:'view'};\n    var a=(ctx&&ctx.answers)||{};if(a.consent!==true){st.step='intro';st.k=0;}\n    if(st.step==='trial'&&st.phase!=='q')st.phase='view';\n    save();route();\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n",
